#~ msgid ""
#~ "Livity is more than a word here;"
#~ " it's a way of living in "
#~ "balance, with each other, with the "
#~ "food we eat, and with the earth"
#~ " that hosts us. In the Cultural "
#~ "Yard, that philosophy takes shape "
#~ "through Ital cooking, prepared the "
#~ "traditional way, and through Reasoning: "
#~ "open circles where elders and newcomers"
#~ " alike sit together to share ideas,"
#~ " stories, and reflections. It's a "
#~ "space built on presence rather than "
#~ "performance, come as you are, sit, "
#~ "listen, and speak when you're moved "
#~ "to."
